# 🏦 CreditRisk360: End-to-End Banking Risk Intelligence & Client Risk Scoring

> Transforming raw banking customer data into actionable lending intelligence through Exploratory Data Analysis, Feature Engineering, Machine Learning, and Interactive Power BI Dashboards.

