Additional calculated fields include:

- Engagement Days
- Income Band
- Processing Fees
- Engagement Timeframe

---

# 💡 Business Insights

The project demonstrates that:

- Financial ratio features outperform raw account balances in identifying customer risk.
- Continuous probability scores provide better prioritization than traditional risk labels.
- Customers with weak liquidity buffers and high borrowing exposure can be identified proactively.
- Interactive dashboards allow business stakeholders to monitor lending risk without requiring technical expertise.

